      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound sense of detachment, which is a very distressing feeling. This feeling of being disconnected from yourself, like an observer in your own life, is sometimes referred to as depersonalization or derealization. It is important to know that these feelings, while incredibly frightening, are often symptoms of significant stress or anxiety. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional who can help you understand and manage these experiences.",
      "source": "target",
